<title>USA: Carver Bancorp Inc begins trading on Amex.</title>
<headline>Carver Bancorp Inc begins trading on Amex.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carver Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday it received approval for the listing of its shares on the American Stock Exchange under the symbol.</p>
<p>The company expects to begin trading on May 21.</p>
<p>Carver's shares are currently listed on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Carver Bancorp is the holding company for Carver Federal Savings Bank, a federally chartered stock savings bank.</p>
</text>
